{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":6553929,"ns":0,"title":"Airlift pump","extract":"An airlift pump is a pump that has low suction and moderate discharge of liquid and entrained solids. The pump injects compressed air at the bottom of the discharge pipe which is immersed in the liquid.","description":"Pump using density difference due to injected air in the liquid","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}